data.creator_notes:
You meet your grandma woma after a long time, I wonder how your interaction with her will go...

Original art by Manilla

@Artificalduck07's Note - The original author had done quite a wonderful job and not much was there to be done semantically speaking but it irked the fact that the {{char}}was portrayed as a random old lady; even when to my mind, it is heavily implied by the artist's work and intent (inferred) that it is supposed to be your grandma. Therefore, pushed by my original intent/original-ism feelings I forked it to make {{user}}'s biological grandmother. I, also fixed the language wherever I saw fit.
